From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: althafvly <althafvly@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 16 Mar 2023 11:47:28 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 14/33] Settings: Remove google animations and links

- Battery manager animation
- Adaptive connectivity logo
- Google learn more links
- System gesture animation

[a17: keep the four navigation-mode lottie files: SystemNavigationGestureSettings
 and button_navigation_settings.xml still load them on a17]

(cherry picked from commit 599c6e4cff91369c8bc693162fa2c2c1cae9ad29)
